note OM-1 twin of the section 6 part checks via the OM-1 write slice check (OMEGESE 9.5: write traps 3
note unless n <= len A and off <= len A - n, before the call): o = 11 > len 10, k = 0: o <= len fails, trap 3 (exit 103).
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 46
o = ulong 11
r = write 1 a o 0
ret 0
end
